    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as your Movement phase's Reinforcements step begins, on 1 **RUBRIC MARINES** or **SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATORS** unit of yours in **Strategic Reserves**.\n\n- A **RUBRIC MARINES** unit has **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** for the rest of the phase.\n- A **SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATOR** unit set up with **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** may be placed anywhere wholly inside the [Flow of Magic](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.hexwarp-thrallband.flow-of-magic) of your army, with every enemy model over 6\" away horizontally.\n- A **SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATORS** unit targeted by this Stratagem cannot declare a charge that turn.",
